WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:04.270
The immune system basically protects us from pathogens.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:07.510
So, a pathogen is a virus like the common
cold

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.650
or it's a bacterial infection or it's a parasite.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:13.880
And these pathogens can make us really sick

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.000
and our immune system protects us from these.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.500
The way that the immune system does this is that it's very good

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:25.200
at telling the difference between what's self
and what's non-self

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.600
and so non-self, obviously, is anything like a virus or bacteria 

00:00:29.609 --> 00:00:33.109
so our immune system is very good at
picking up anything

00:00:33.109 --> 00:00:35.500
that doesn't belong to our bodies and rejecting it. 

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.500
All cells in our body

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:42.760
have a very distinct set of markers
or proteins on their cell surface

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:47.339
and these act as a barcode and the
immune system can read

00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:51.170
these cells, this barcode, and it immediately
sends a signal

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:55.989
that that cell is foreign and not part of the
body and needs to be destroyed immediately,

00:00:55.989 --> 00:01:00.010
or that it's a self cell and it's fine, harmless, leave it alone.

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:03.389
So these Devil Facial Tumour Disease cells should

00:01:03.389 --> 00:01:06.580
automatically be recognised by the devil
immune system

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:09.750
as something that's foreign, that's come
from another animal

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.800
but for some reason that doesn't happen.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:17.400
The way that this cancer, in the Tasmanian devil, does this is that it changes what it looks like

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.200
it puts on a disguise

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:22.700
they're changing the proteins and markers they have on their cell surface

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:25.900
which means that the devil immune system can't see them. 

